{
  "mn45:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 45 ",
  "mn45:0.2": "Cūḷadhammasamādānasutta ",
  "mn45:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn45:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn45:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn45:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn45:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn45:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn45:2.1": "“cattārimāni, bhikkhave, dhammasamādānāni. ",
  "mn45:2.2": "Katamāni cattāri? ",
  "mn45:2.3": "Atthi, bhikkhave, dhammasamādānaṁ paccuppannasukhaṁ āyatiṁ dukkhavipākaṁ; ",
  "mn45:2.4": "atthi, bhikkhave, dhammasamādānaṁ paccuppannadukkhañceva āyatiñca dukkhavipākaṁ; ",
  "mn45:2.5": "atthi, bhikkhave, dhammasamādānaṁ paccuppannadukkhaṁ āyatiṁ sukhavipākaṁ; ",
  "mn45:2.6": "atthi, bhikkhave, dhammasamādānaṁ paccuppannasukhañceva āyatiñca sukhavipākaṁ. ",
  "mn45:3.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, dhammasamādānaṁ paccuppannasukhaṁ āyatiṁ dukkhavipākaṁ? ",
  "mn45:3.2": "Santi, bhikkhave, eke samaṇabrāhmaṇā evaṁvādino evaṁdiṭṭhino: ",
  "mn45:3.3": "‘natthi kāmesu doso’ti. ",
  "mn45:3.4": "Te kāmesu pātabyataṁ āpajjanti. ",
  "mn45:3.5": "Te kho moḷibaddhāhi paribbājikāhi paricārenti. ",
  "mn45:3.6": "Te evamāhaṁsu: ",
  "mn45:3.7": "‘kiṁsu nāma te bhonto samaṇabrāhmaṇā kāmesu anāgatabhayaṁ sampassamānā kāmānaṁ pahānamāhaṁsu, kāmānaṁ pariñña�